# Convex

Follow `.cursor/skills/convex/SKILL.md`.

- Validators on `args` and `returns` for new functions.
- Index queries. Pass time into queries. Hash tokens at rest.
- Ingest that would pass a cap fails. Do not drop rows.
- No production `npx convex deploy` and no Convex setting changes.
